title A pass back to the goalie
intro A teammate has the ball.

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player B-CM at 33.6, 34
  ball with B-CM

step
  caption A Blue teammate has the ball.
  draw penalty-area left

step
  caption They kick it back to the goalie.
  ball to 9.5, 34
  arrow from B-CM to ball
  draw penalty-area left
  duration 1300

question
  prompt What should they do?
  answer Use their feet
  wrong Pick it up
  wrong Throw-in
  wrong Corner kick
  why They have to play it with their feet.

step
  caption The goalie cannot pick this one up.
  B-CM to 27.3, 34
  B-G to 9.5, 34
  ball with B-G
  label B-G Kick
  no-hands
  draw penalty-area left

step
  caption They kick it away with their feet.
  ball to 25.2, 27.2
  arrow from B-G to ball
  no-hands
  draw penalty-area left
  banner No pickup
  duration 1200
